  "question": {
    "text": "The oxoacid of phosphorus that is easily obtained from a reaction of alkali and white phosphorus and has two <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math> bonds, is"
